{"id":"665539","name":"一锅鲜","author":"putimama","authorId":"8334261","desc":"","cover":"images/665539/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"香菇","amount":"3朵"},{"name":"胡萝卜","amount":"1根"}],"sub":[{"name":"大虾","amount":"4个"},{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"2个"},{"name":"海参","amount":"4个"},{"name":"鸡汤","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"香菇切花，胡萝卜去皮切斜片。","img":"images/665539/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"荷包蛋先煮为，海参泡好。","img":"images/665539/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"锅中加入鸡汤，盐、放入胡萝卜煮至六分熟。","img":"images/665539/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"再加入焯好的大虾、荷花蛋。","img":"images/665539/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"稍煮即可。","img":"images/665539/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"汤鲜味美，营养丰富。","img":"images/665539/step_6.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：不粘锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}